sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Browser
    participant UI as UiService
    participant Controller

    User->>Browser: Open demo app
    Browser->>UI: Request frontend
    UI-->>Browser: Serve UI
    User->>Browser: Upload video
    Browser->>UI: Open WebSocket and send chunks
    UI->>Controller: StreamContentLocalization()
    Controller-->>UI: Stream output chunks
    UI-->>Browser: Stream output chunks
    Browser-->>User: Preview and download result
    Browser->>UI: Close WebSocket
